<title>UK: Ford to launch $750 mln Euro-Asian bond next week.</title>
<headline>Ford to launch $750 mln Euro-Asian bond next week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Credit will launch a $750 million Euro-Asian FRN next week, Lehman Brothers said on Thursday in a statement as joint lead manager.</p>
<p>The maturity range was indicated at from three to seven years. Merrill Lynch is the other joint lead.  </p>
<p>Ther notes will be list in Luxembourg, Hong Kong and Singapore.</p>
<p>Ford launched a $750 million five-year fixed-rate Euro-Asian bond last May.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
